| Name         | Description                         | Units  |   Default value |
| ------------ | ----------------------------------- | ------ | --------------- |
| `drive_train_mechanics_3d`         | Expose frame_a and apply the shafts' gyroscopic/inertial reactions to it                         | --  |   true |
| `housing_reaction`         | Apply the final-drive housing reaction to frame_a; disable when the axles drive wheel-joint axis flanges directly (reaction already enters through the joints)                         | --  |   drive_train_mechanics_3d |
| `final_ratio`         | Final drive speed ratio, axle speed / driveshaft speed                         | --  |   0.2 |
| `n_drive`         | Driveshaft rotation axis, resolved in frame_a                         | --  |   [1, 0, 0] |
| `n_axle`         | Axle rotation axis, resolved in frame_a                         | --  |   [0, 0, 1] |
| `J_driveshaft`         | Driveshaft inertia                         | kg.m2  |   0.5 |
| `J_diffbox`         | Differential housing inertia                         | kg.m2  |   0.6 |
| `J_axle`         | Axle shaft inertia, per side                         | kg.m2  |   0.4 |

## Connectors

 * `flange_transmission` - This connector represents a rotational spline with angle and torque as the potential and flow variables, respectively. ([`Spline`](@ref))
 * `flange_left` - This connector represents a rotational spline with angle and torque as the potential and flow variables, respectively. ([`Spline`](@ref))
